{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I haven't had to deal with anything like this for over a year. Then you all show up and everything goes to hell! Maybe you should all just leave.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:29:48.612000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741090687134728343","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"What do you know of 'the hunger' ?\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:30:53.381000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741090958795472986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I know it killed that Goddess. I know it's a dark evil. And I know it shouldn't be something to mess with. It's very powerful.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:31:50.330000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741091197657022544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"My creator faught against it... He and 3 others gave their lives in an attempt to destroy it...\" He looks back to the town \"to protect these colonists.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:32:54.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741091466075439165","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"Rockman looks back at Lilia quickly","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:33:16.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741091559944224869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"These colonist seem to only cause trouble.\" She says bitterly","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:33:37.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741091648007700531","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"What have they done that has benefited anything on this island?\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:34:04.769000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-07T00:34:12.063000Z","id":"741091761534795807","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"Rockman looks to the side \"I do not know, but I am sure that their intentions are good.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:38:04.486000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741092766980767875","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"Good intentions are for fools. You need to be better than simply meaning well. Think about what you all are doing in a land you don't know with people you don't know. I have been here for sometime and I've learned much. I have tried to help you all but I can't keep a whole town in check. Everything was easier when you all just weren't here!\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:40:45.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741093442699919400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"You would call my creator a fool, for attempting to save gods?\" He glares at her \"you would call a mass of people fools, for wishing the best to a land they have wrecked on?\" Rockman seems stern in his conviction. \"These people that have came here no longer have a choice or a means to leave. They are stuck here.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:47:13.088000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741095067984330752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739565107092389939","content":"\"I suggest you leave.  I want no part of whatever mess your colony has gotten this island in.\"","created_at":"2020-08-07T00:49:44.613000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741095703526506524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
